          "url": "https://github.com/pasky/claude.vim/blob/06baac1ed4503e6c642193c56a27238ca67b5911/README.md#L48-L48"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_6f070db267a56a63ae2855c6136735edd0f43726baba21ebc8e473da7da0d70c",
        "slc_76f599852b67406bcb75023874fc9a96f86fedeca63c0205f0375ab9c75cd551",
        "slc_a21a2f684250c4cedb3b54d52abe4463e9f0aba3b7573ec07c7b1bddcbe9991d"
      ],
      "text": "The current version can also execute shell scripts, and the plugin can search the web when it lacks knowledge, with web access requiring elinks or felinks installed."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_b5abb95f3f3e6459767f2ef32c921303392f5208cc71734431185a594b389226",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "06baac1ed4503e6c642193c56a27238ca67b5911",
          "git_sha": "ff6edccf754135491167a2af438b1d53a97cecac",
          "line_end": 93,
          "line_start": 90,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "pasky/claude.vim",
          "url": "https://github.com/pasky/claude.vim/blob/06baac1ed4503e6c642193c56a27238ca67b5911/README.md#L90-L93"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_76f599852b67406bcb75023874fc9a96f86fedeca63c0205f0375ab9c75cd551"
      ],
      "text": "Web access depends on installing elinks or felinks; Google search additionally requires a one-time manual cookie-consent step in elinks."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_b3d2a3a113433b0327b82fa572039d0c4b5894c27b9ac6db331414f61fdd689d",
