          "url": "https://github.com/pasky/claude.vim/blob/06baac1ed4503e6c642193c56a27238ca67b5911/README.md#L111-L111"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_6a51d5ffd1f5b779450b6f0dbb3031ab79c5fe7bcd465de0a7a2afcc69ff9c1c",
        "slc_7d7de6b0ca5cf6597d7ecb763fefc027fc574e9f614694ca325f350000f328cf",
        "slc_fe7efb861c865e504ab12a6368e80929936d908d927c917e764378bc5e85dd45"
      ],
      "text": "The plugin uses the Anthropic Claude API by default (API key set via g:claude_api_key), with AWS Bedrock available as an alternative provider via g:claude_use_bedrock."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_517af2b4125878100c8cbde83c2e48511aef95c9f18dcdb2ef122a5e167df5f0",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "06baac1ed4503e6c642193c56a27238ca67b5911",
          "git_sha": "ff6edccf754135491167a2af438b1d53a97cecac",
          "line_end": 19,
          "line_start": 12,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "pasky/claude.vim",
          "url": "https://github.com/pasky/claude.vim/blob/06baac1ed4503e6c642193c56a27238ca67b5911/README.md#L12-L19"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_510210815074ba6e2d87fbf0405f69abaa49973cab767eff1f9380e776ee9a68"
      ],
      "text": "The plugin is explicitly not code completion like Copilot; it provides a chat/instruction-centric interface optimized for human collaboration, with chat history access and vimdiff review as key features."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_1bed4b64f90aa730550980d6038a12ae1b89a4f7b6e93917efa00c2098c63947",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "06baac1ed4503e6c642193c56a27238ca67b5911",
          "git_sha": "ff6edccf754135491167a2af438b1d53a97cecac",
          "line_end": 60,
          "line_start": 58,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "pasky/claude.vim",
          "url": "https://github.com/pasky/claude.vim/blob/06baac1ed4503e6c642193c56a27238ca67b5911/README.md#L58-L60"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_931b619763e6fe40fda47d8fabc0c19b0395bf9e53b82f72114c17b6e407a31d"
      ],
      "text": "Because Sonnet 3.5 is not deemed capable of fully autonomous complex tasks, the design keeps the human in control: users chat, review, and can reject changes and tool execution attempts."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_a7e1944d19dafdbc9423b023d42332b8175d6210863e4cd985c584943fdb9b5c",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "limitations",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
